  "name": "PLC Design",
  "level": "process",
  "parent": "electronics.industrial-control",
  "description": "Programmable Logic Controller architecture and programming — rack/chassis hardware (CPU, power supply, I/O modules), opto-isolated input modules, relay/triac/transistor output modules, deterministic scan-cycle execution, IEC 61131-3 programming languages (LD, FBD, ST, SFC, IL), and industrial communication (Modbus, EtherNet/IP, Profinet) for software-reconfigurable factory and process control.",
